/**
 * One widget class and one receiver per Gallery design.
 *
 * Generated by 	ools/generate_gallery_widgets.ps1 ??edit that, not this.
 *
 * A design needs a provider of its own for the launcher to place it, and a widget
 * class of its own for Glance to tell it apart: Glance goes by the class, so designs
 * sharing one cannot be redrawn separately. Between them that is what lets two clocks
 * sit side by side, each showing its own face and its own time.
 */

